    "rebuilt_sha256": "c0d7656fe3a9629629705f55f27a04cc5b6e600ae6115cc58e61d3e343e619e4",
    "rebuild_note": "The reference labels are read off a rebuild of the sealed pack, and the rebuild reproduces the sha256 the pack was sealed with before a label is read. The returned CSV is gitignored; this is how the run proves it is scoring against what the operator ruled on."
